; A task's address numbers (D243) wrap past 2^19, half a million, now
; that a pid carries its island (D256) and shares its tag with symbols
; (D260), skipping any still open: the root keeps its first, 0, open,
; makes and closes 524,287 more, and the next wraps to 0, which is taken,
; so it's 1. Expected output worked out by hand.

(defun churn (n)
    (if (== n 0) () (do (disconnect (address)) (churn (- n 1)))))

(let first (address))
(churn 524287)
(list first (address) (address))
